# Site structure doc

`docs/site-structure.md` is the map other models read. When a change adds or alters a route, actor, table, column, redirect, portal or admin flow, or other public behavior, update that file in the same change.

Describe the product as built. When the doc and the code disagree, fix the doc to match the code. Do not leave a new route, status, or data rule only in a pull request body.
